 "subtitles": [
  {
   "at": 2.0,
   "until": 10.54,
   "text": "Hey! Let's take five together. Sit tall, feet flat on the floor\u2026 and close your eyes if you like."
  },
  {
   "at": 19.0,
   "until": 27.71,
   "text": "Only go as far as feels good. Breathe in\u2026 and let it all go."
  },
  {
   "at": 30.6,
   "until": 35.22,
   "text": "Reach both arms up. Big reach! Leaves up."
  },
  {
   "at": 41.0,
   "until": 42.98,
   "text": "Breathe into the stretch."
  },
  {
   "at": 50.6,
   "until": 54.75,
   "text": "Now lean over to the left. Long and easy."
  },
  {
   "at": 61.0,
   "until": 63.05,
   "text": "Feel your side open up."
  },
  {
   "at": 70.6,
   "until": 72.5,
   "text": "And over to the right."
  },
  {
   "at": 81.0,
   "until": 83.61,
   "text": "Nice. Breathe."
  },
  {
   "at": 90.6,
   "until": 95.3,
   "text": "Hands behind your head, elbows wide. Open up your chest."
  },
  {
   "at": 101.0,
   "until": 103.3,
   "text": "Lift your gaze a little."
  },
  {
   "at": 110.6,
   "until": 116.75,
   "text": "Arms out like a little cactus\u2026 gently squeeze your shoulder blades together."
  },
  {
   "at": 121.0,
   "until": 126.74,
   "text": "And soften. Squeeze\u2026 and soften."
  },
  {
   "at": 130.6,
   "until": 135.22,
   "text": "Drop your left ear toward your shoulder. No rush."
  },
  {
   "at": 141.0,
   "until": 143.3,
   "text": "Let your shoulders melt down."
  },
  {
   "at": 150.6,
   "until": 152.74,
   "text": "And the other side."
  },
  {
   "at": 161.0,
   "until": 163.14,
   "text": "Breathe out the day."
  },
  {
   "at": 170.6,
   "until": 178.91,
   "text": "Now fold forward, slowly. Let your arms hang. Dig's doing his downward dog."
  },
  {
   "at": 183.5,
   "until": 185.96,
   "text": "Let your head be heavy."
  },
  {
   "at": 195.6,
   "until": 201.18,
   "text": "Sit up slowly. Cross your right ankle over your left knee."
  },
  {
   "at": 206.0,
   "until": 207.74,
   "text": "Reach up tall."
  },
  {
   "at": 215.6,
   "until": 221.34,
   "text": "Now twist toward that knee\u2026 and look over your shoulder."
  },
  {
   "at": 226.0,
   "until": 230.61,
   "text": "Breathe in tall\u2026 and twist a little more as you breathe out."
  },
  {
   "at": 235.6,
   "until": 239.34,
   "text": "Switch sides. Left ankle over your right knee."
  },
  {
   "at": 246.0,
   "until": 247.91,
   "text": "Reach up."
  },
  {
   "at": 255.6,
   "until": 258.62,
   "text": "And twist. Look back over your shoulder."
  },
  {
   "at": 266.0,
   "until": 267.91,
   "text": "One more breath here."
  },
  {
   "at": 275.6,
   "until": 281.9,
   "text": "Feet back on the floor. Hands on your thighs. Close your eyes."
  },
  {
   "at": 282.3,
   "until": 284.85,
   "text": "Three slow breaths with me."
  },
  {
   "at": 287.0,
   "until": 289.31,
   "text": "Breathe in\u2026"
  },
  {
   "at": 290.0,
   "until": 291.35,
   "text": "and out\u2026"
  },
  {
   "at": 293.0,
   "until": 294.5,
   "text": "In\u2026"
  },
  {
   "at": 296.0,
   "until": 298.3,
   "text": "and out\u2026"
  },
  {
   "at": 298.3,
   "until": 301.08,
   "text": "Last one. In\u2026"
  },
  {
   "at": 302.0,
   "until": 304.14,
   "text": "and all the way out."
  },
  {
   "at": 306.5,
   "until": 311.1,
   "text": "Now slowly open your eyes. That's it, you did it!"
  },
  {
   "at": 311.1,
   "until": 313.9,
   "text": "Back to work you go, nice and easy."
  },
  {
   "at": 313.9,
   "until": 319.93,
   "text": "Remember to stretch now and then\u2026 and I'll come find you when it's time for another break. \ud83e\udd55"
  }
